   "tag_name": "v0.5.12",
   "draft": false,
   "prerelease": false,
   "body": "Share back with Soulseek: a new Settings card lets you share some of your tracks (50 to 500) with other Soulseek users. Many people on Soulseek serve those who share first, so this makes your downloads faster. Off unless you turn it on. It uses no extra disk space and doesn't change your Rekordbox folders; uploads are limited to 2 at a time with a speed cap (both adjustable). Note: sharing means others can download these files from you, and in some countries sharing copyrighted music can bring notices from rights holders.\n",
