   "tag_name": "v0.5.11",
   "draft": false,
   "prerelease": false,
   "body": "WAV and AIFF: the Quality list now has FLAC, WAV and AIFF as separate choices, alongside MP3 320/256/192 and SoundCloud / YouTube. Rank them in any order you like (up to 7 choices); your current list carries over. New option under Quality: \"Convert FLAC and WAV downloads to AIFF\", for older CDJs that can't play FLAC (keeps 16/24-bit, brings anything above 48 kHz down to 48 kHz; needs ffmpeg). WAV and AIFF files are tagged and added to the Rekordbox list like everything else.\n",
