   "draft": false,
   "prerelease": false,
   "body": "Security update. Soulseek's built-in web page is now only reachable from your own computer (before, other devices on your Wi-Fi could open it), with its own private login. SoulSearch's window only answers itself, so a website can't control it behind your back. Updates are checked more strictly before installing. SoulSearch updates now come from this page. The first start after updating restarts Soulseek once, if nothing is downloading.\n",
